### Inspect Video AudioInly
POST {{api_host}}/video/inspect
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AudioInly
Accept: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

--AudioInly
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="audio_only.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/x-m4a

< ../tests/fixtures/media/audio_only.m4a
--AudioInly--

